OL,3,GNEWSAWhy shining a laser at an air
OL,4,Aambulance could be 'catastrophic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn air ambulance pilot has warned
OL,7,Fshining laser-pointers at an aircraft
OL,8,Fcould end up having "catastrophic"
OL,9,Fconsequences.
OL,11,FHis warning comes as the Civil Aviation
OL,12,FAuthority (CAA) released its latest
OL,13,Fstatistics, finding in the 18 months to
OL,14,FJune 2026 there were 129 incidents of
OL,15,Fair ambulances being target by the
OL,16,Fdevices.
OL,18,FThe CAA said the illegal activity was a
OL,19,Fnationwide problem but highlighted
OL,20,Fspecific cases in places like Taunton,
OL,21,FSomerset, and Torquay and Plymouth in
OL,22,FDevon.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
