OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy shining a laser at an air
OL,4,Aambulance could be 'catastrophic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCpt Kevin Sutherland, chief pilot at
OL,7,FDorset and Somerset Air Ambulance, said
OL,8,Fthe issue was "stopping these
OL,9,Fhelicopters actually getting to these
OL,10,Fcritical patients to give them the
OL,11,Fcare" and could do "serious damage" to
OL,12,Feyes.
